# Green Ankh key (items.md Keys), world pickup. Same shape as the HUD icon
# assets/src/hud/key_green.pix, scaled to 16x24: loop head in fb_green (the key's
# fullbright colour, shaded on its far side by the ramp), green ramp crossbar
# and stem lit from the top-left. Frame 0 of the 18-tic shimmer: an
# fb_white glint on the head moves from top-left (f0) down the left side (f1).
name key_green_idle_d0_f0
size 16 24
= 1 green_02
= 2 green_04
= 3 green_06
= 4 green_08
= 5 green_10
= 6 green_11
= F fb_green
= W fb_white
outline fb_green green_00
outline fb_white green_00
grid
.....FFFFF.....
....WFFFFF5....
...FFF...F54...
...FF.....F4...
...FF.....F4...
...FF.....54...
....FF...F4....
....FF...54....
.....FF.F4.....
......FF4......
56666666666665.
45555555544432.
3444444444333..
